\n　The character in the reference image: Futaba\n　The character in the reference image is Futaba, a lively, clumsy girl.\n\nComposition\n　The white jacket is left up to you.\n　The composition is up to you.\n　It would be nice if the upper half of the body is not cut off.\n　I would be happy if the background could be output with transparency, as I would like to use it for distribution and other activities.\n\n\nI would like to use it for distribution and other activities.\n　Thumbnails and headers for distribution.\n\nThank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/lyJfhUD\nhttps://imgur.com/a/OlFGRNT", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@icgmcmc/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2587750, "client_id": 935608, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fb04baa8/uploads/origins/41993f91-371c-49b1-9746-5db43ee93643?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=489cef721f9152d50c43bf5f71e6c707", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fb04baa8/uploads/origins/41993f91-371c-49b1-9746-5db43ee93643?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=489cef721f9152d50c43bf5f71e6c707, https://si.imgix.net/fb04baa8/uploads/origins/41993f91-371c-49b1-9746-5db43ee93643?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e10c2b8690f5a3c17863b3fcbf6314c5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fb04baa8/uploads/origins/41993f91-371c-49b1-9746-5db43ee93643?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04e007bd6ef49bcfafe1194cfb4b4282 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fb04baa8/uploads/origins/41993f91-371c-49b1-9746-5db43ee93643?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2310365352a60f9f3486c37857ae